<title>JAPAN: Japan Sept lead imports off 40.1 pct year/year.</title>
<headline>Japan Sept lead imports off 40.1 pct year/year.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's refined lead imports in September totalled 1,089 tonnes, off 40.1 percent from 1,817 tonnes in the same month a year earlier, Finance Ministry data issued on Tuesday showed.</p>
<p>The breakdown is as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>		   Sept 96	    Aug 96	  Sept 95</p>
<p> Total	    1,089	     2,166	    1,817</p>
<p>Major suppliers:</p>
<p> China		615	     1,029		598</p>
<p> Peru		 160		 415		501</p>
<p>Cumulative imports in the first nine months of 1996 were 28,112 tonnes against 70,542 during the same period of 1995. -- Tokyo Commodities Desk +81-3-3432-6179</p>
</text>
